Aerographene topbar fidelity fix (GPL-3.0): space name keeps its width and is
elided only above 160px (also in the sidebar row); pinned open in the topbar
get the 1px outline and a globe when there is no favicon.
Depends on: aerographene/topbar-mockup.patch, aerographene/pixelized-type.patch.

